<title>USA: First Chicago NBD Q4 oper net up. [CORRECTED 14:47 GMT]</title>
<headline>First Chicago NBD Q4 oper net up. [CORRECTED 14:47 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr dil	     $1.14		     0.96</p>
<p> Oper net		 377,000		  318,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     327,600		  326,900</p>
<p>(Corrects to clarify that Oper net figures are in millions)</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results exclude $267 million in merger related charges taken in the fourth quarter.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr dil	     $4.32		    $3.99</p>
<p> Oper net	    $1,436,000		1,341,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs dil	   328,100		  330,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>ASSETS: $104.6 billion vs $122.0 billion</p>
<p>LOANS: $65.0 billion vs $63.1 billion</p>
<p>DEPOSITS: $63.7 billion vs $69.1 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: Full year 1996 includes one-time charge of $0.04 a share related to recapitalization of Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
